{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward: Every Purchase Costs Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your spacecraft in this innovative top-down shooter where every strategic decision impacts your final score. Defend Enfora Star space station against droid swarms, but here's the twist: every turret, wall, and allied drone you purchase reduces your high score. Do you play it safe with heavy defenses, or risk everything for maximum points?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Arcade-Style Space Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter around the besieged station in intense retro-style action. Weave through enemy formations with precision timing, evading incoming fire while striking back from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the battleground by constructing tactical defenses. Deploy walls to create choke points, install automated turrets for additional firepower, and recruit allied drones to fight alongside you. Collect power-ups and weapon upgrades to enhance your arsenal as you design a defensive network that complements your combat style. But remember - every credit spent is a point lost. The ultimate challenge isn't just surviving the waves, but mastering the risk-reward balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Arcade Dilemma</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much are you willing to sacrifice for victory? This isn't just about lasting longest - it's about achieving the perfect balance between aggressive piloting, strategic spending, and score optimization. Will you emerge as a cautious survivor or a legendary point-chaser?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Unique risk/reward scoring system - every purchase reduces your final score</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Classic arcade shooter experience</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Intense fast-paced space combat</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Multiple weapons and power-ups</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Weapon damage and armor upgrade systems</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Defensive building system with turrets</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- Allied drone recruitment</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552750?t=1757687866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552750?t=1757687866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/b4bfe309b1580583a5cca07e8506e1a9bd9ae533/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757687866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/b4bfe309b1580583a5cca07e8506e1a9bd9ae533/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757687866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward: Every Purchase Costs Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your spacecraft in this innovative top-down shooter where every strategic decision impacts your final score. Defend Enfora Star space station against droid swarms, but here's the twist: every turret, wall, and allied drone you purchase reduces your high score. Do you play it safe with heavy defenses, or risk everything for maximum points?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Arcade-Style Space Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragr